             an aerodrome (all open), sent without a prior request.
  Scenario:  Example 4 - Runway Status Messages.
  PIXM:      0.5
  Exercises: SimpleRunwayStatusMessage (AbstractPIXMNotification), SimpleRunwayEndStatus.
  Data:      Illustrative only, based on a real aerodrome (LSZH). Identifiers are fictional.
             Not for operational use.
-->
<pixm:SimpleRunwayStatusMessage xmlns:pixm="http://www.pixm.aero/schema/0.5"
